ema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:d7ac18dc87f772f19c9fb735f02c038f07af209a12cadfb2e0c9e7b136861505","file":"preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex","line":48,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"1581b743d0b2e9ffa10c5dbe9defecfe2d05973978311df0170e7c794d894ca3","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:d7ac18dc87f772f19c9fb735f02c038f07af209a12cadfb2e0c9e7b136861505","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Signed-tensor-densities-and-diagram-budgets-for-coordinate-sweeps-September-26-2026/build/sections/00-introduction.tex#L48"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{ten:spin:main}\\label{s:spin-moment}\nFor each sufficiently small fixed $\\bar\\eta>0$, choose a sufficiently\nsmall $\\bar\\kappa>0$ with $\\bar\\kappa<\\bar\\eta/256$. There is an\ninteger $r\\ge1$, depending only on these fixed constants, such that for\nevery $d\\ge1$, every $\\lambda\\vdash n=2^d$, and every\noccurrence~\\eqref{ten:spin:eq:1},\n\\begin{equation}\\label{ten:spin:eq:3}\n \\log\\!\\left(D_\\lambda\\operatorname{Tr}_{V_\\lambda}(B_n^*B_n)^r\\right)\n \\le\\eta_d F(\\alpha,\\beta)+g_n(l),\n\\end{equation}\nwhere\n\\[\n \\eta_d=\\bar\\eta\\left(1-\\frac1{2\\sqrt d}\\right),\\qquad\n \\kappa_d=\\bar\\kappa\\left(1-\\frac1{2\\sqrt d}\\right),\\qquad\n g_n(l)=\\max\\{0,\\kappa_d l\\log n-l\\log(n/l)\\}.\n\\]\nSet $g_n(0)=0$ and interpret the logarithm of a zero trace as $-\\infty$."}
